{"id": "61e96d75-793f-42d3-a907-18a93b071481", "slug": "lesson-loom-signal-scanner", "title": "Lesson Loom Signal Scanner", "description": "Lesson Loom Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Lesson Loom Signal Scanner\"\ndescription: \"Lesson Loom Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#4F5FD5\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#8B6EF7\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#2D2F46\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#D2C7BB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"IBM Plex Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Instrument Sans\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"IBM Plex Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"26px\"\n  control: \"25px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Lesson Loom Signal Scanner\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Samnang Aing (@samnang). Views: 61; favorites: 3; remixes: 4.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, threejs, cta, dither, social-proof, flow.\n## Overview\nLesson Loom Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nLESSON LOOM / v2.4 SESSION 042 SIGNAL SCANNER TEACHING SIGNAL LESSON-042 00 SIGNALS FOUND SCANNING CLASS ARC 45 MIN DRIFT 0.12 GAPS 00 CH-07 12 % FOCUS DIAL GOAL SCAF CHECK LIVE UPLINK 99.2% TZ-PST OPEN SIGNAL CONSOLE\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nFollow the rendered preview for headline scale, supporting copy, navigation density, and component placement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #4F5FD5, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #8B6EF7, background #FFFFFF, surface #2D2F46, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse IBM Plex Mono for display moments and Instrument Sans for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use IBM Plex Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Lesson Loom Aurora Scanner</title>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500;600&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  :root {\n    --page: #eef1f6;\n    --paper: #f7f5ee;\n    --porcelain: #f3efe6;\n    --porcelain-2: #e7e0d4;\n    --ridge: #d2c7bb;\n\n    --ink: #182033;\n    --muted: #7a8093;\n    --soft-muted: #9ba1b2;\n\n    --indigo: #4f5fd5;\n    --violet: #8b6ef7;\n    --aqua: #5edfd2;\n    --mint: #a8f3d0;\n    --coral: #ee7d67;\n\n    --shadow: rgba(45, 47, 70, 0.22);\n    --shadow-strong: rgba(45, 47, 70, 0.34);\n  }\n\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;\n    background: var(--page);\n  }\n\n  .font-sans {\n    font-family: 'Instrument Sans', sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .soft-frame-line {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent, rgba(79,95,213,0.20), transparent);\n  }\n\n  .corner-pin {\n    border: 1px solid rgba(79,95,213,0.24);\n    background: rgba(247,245,238,0.42);\n    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\n  }\n\n  .outer-rim {\n    background: linear-gradient(\n      180deg,\n      rgba(255,255,255,0.96) 0%,\n      rgba(94,223,210,0.24) 42%,\n      rgba(139,110,247,0.28) 100%\n    );\n  }\n\n  .scanner-shell {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f7f5ee 0%, #ece6d9 58%, #ded3c4 100%);\n    box-shadow:\n      rgba(45,47,70,0.22) 0px 60px 100px -20px,\n      rgb(203,194,181) 0px 10px 0px 0px,\n      rgba(79,95,213,0.24) 0px 12px 4px 0px,\n      rgba(255,255,255,0.95) 0px 1px 1px 0px inset,\n      rgba(79,95,213,0.10) 0px -1px 2px 0px inset;\n  }\n\n  .panel-well {\n    background: #ded6ca;\n    box-shadow:\n      rgba(45,47,70,0.28) 0px 4px 12px 0px inset,\n      rgba(79,95,213,0.28) 0px 0px 0px 1px inset,\n      rgba(255,255,255,0.82) 0px 1px 1px 0px;\n  }\n\n  .screen {\n    background: #fbf8f1;\n    box-shadow:\n      inset 0 0 40px rgba(94,223,210,0.10),\n      inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.70);\n  }\n\n  .bottom-strip {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg,#fbf8f1,#e9dfd0);\n    box-shadow:\n      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.94),\n      inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(79,95,213,0.16);\n  }\n\n  .track {\n    background: #d7ccbc;\n    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(45,47,70,0.22);\n  }\n\n  .dial-base {\n    background: #d8cec0;\n    box-shadow:\n      inset 0 3px 10px rgba(45,47,70,0.28),\n      inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.74),\n      0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.86);\n  }\n\n  .dial-face {\n    background: repeating-radial-gradient(\n      circle at 50% 50%,\n      #fbf8f1 0,\n      #fbf8f1 1px,\n      #d7ccbc 1.5px,\n      #d7ccbc 2.5px\n    );\n  }\n\n  .dial-glass {\n    mix-blend-mode: soft-light;\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.95) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 45%, rgba(79,95,213,0.24) 100%);\n    box-shadow:\n      -2px -2px 6px rgba(255,255,255,0.72),\n      6px 10px 14px rgba(45,47,70,0.16),\n      inset 0 2px 3px rgba(255,255,255,0.84);\n  }\n\n  .button-tray {\n    background: #d8cec0;\n    box-shadow:\n      inset 0 2px 6px rgba(45,47,70,0.24),\n      0 1px 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.86);\n  }\n\n  .device-dot {\n    background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, #f9f5ec, #a9a0bf);\n    box-shadow:\n      inset 0 0 2px rgba(45,47,70,0.35),\n      0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.74);\n  }\n\n  .scan-glow {\n    background: linear-gradient(\n      90deg,\n      transparent 0%,\n      rgba(94,223,210,0.10) 34%,\n      rgba(139,110,247,0.16) 66%,\n      transparent 100%\n    );\n  }\n\n  .top-gloss {\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.42) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);\n  }\n\n  .cta-button {\n    color: #ffffff;\n    background: linear-gradient(180deg,#7c8af8,#4f5fd5);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(79,95,213,0.42);\n    box-shadow:\n      0 8px 20px rgba(79,95,213,0.30),\n      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.42);\n  }\n\n  .cta-button:hover {\n    transform: scale(1.02);\n    box-shadow:\n      0 10px 26px rgba(79,95,213,0.38),\n      inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.48);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n\n<body class=\"m-0 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden antialiased select-none relative\">\n\n<div id=\"shader-bg\" class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n\n<div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-[1] pointer-events-none flex justify-center\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n  <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[860px] h-full\">\n    <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 left-6 w-px soft-frame-line\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 right-6 w-px soft-frame-line\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute left-4 top-6 w-2.5 h-2.5 corner-pin\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute right-4 top-6 w-2.5 h-2.5 corner-pin\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute left-4 bottom-6 w-2.5 h-2.5 corner-pin\"></div>\n    <div class=\"absolute right-4 bottom-6 w-2.5 h-2.5 corner-pin\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[860px] p-6 z-10 flex flex-col items-center gap-5\">\n\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between w-full max-w-[760px] px-2\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs tracking-[0.25em] font-light\" style=\"color:var(--muted);\">\n      <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:waveform-linear\" class=\"text-sm\" style=\"color:var(--indigo);\"></iconify-icon>\n      LESSON LOOM / v2.4\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.25em] font-light hidden sm:block\" style=\"color:var(--muted);\">SESSION 042</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"p-px rounded-[26px] w-full max-w-[760px] outer-rim\">\n\n    <div class=\"relative flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-5 p-6 rounded-[25px] scanner-shell\">\n\n      <div class=\"absolute text-xs tracking-[0.3em] font-light z-20 top-3 right-6\" style=\"color:var(--soft-muted); text-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.62);\">\n        AURORA SCANNER\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"absolute top-3 left-4 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full device-dot\"></div>\n      <div class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-4 w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full device-dot\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"relative flex-1 flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-[12px] p-2.5 z-[5] panel-well\">\n\n        <div class=\"relative flex-1 rounded-[8px] overflow-hidden min-h-[300px] screen\">\n\n          <canvas id=\"matrix-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full z-[1]\"></canvas>\n\n          <div id=\"scanline\" class=\"absolute top-0 bottom-0 w-[80px] z-[8] pointer-events-none scan-glow\" style=\"left:-80px;\"></div>\n\n          <div class=\"absolute left-0 right-0 top-0 bottom-1/2 pointer-events-none z-[10] top-gloss\"></div>\n\n          <div class=\"absolute flex flex-col justify-between pointer-events-none z-[15] inset-4\">\n\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-baseline\">\n              <div class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.25em] font-light\" style=\"color:var(--muted);\">LEARNING SIGNAL</div>\n              <div class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.25em] font-light\" style=\"color:var(--muted);\">LESSON-042</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"mt-auto mb-4\">\n              <div class=\"text-6xl font-thin tracking-tight leading-none\" style=\"color:var(--indigo); text-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.7);\">\n                <span id=\"val-count\">00</span>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.25em] font-light mt-1\" style=\"color:var(--muted);\">INSIGHTS FOUND</div>\n              <div class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.25em] font-light mt-2 flex items-center gap-1.5\" id=\"val-status\" style=\"color:var(--violet);\">\n                <span class=\"inline-block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background:var(--violet); box-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(139,110,247,0.65);\"></span>\n                SCANNING\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end\">\n              <div>\n                <div class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.25em] font-light\" style=\"color:var(--muted);\">CLASS ARC</div>\n                <div class=\"text-base font-light mt-1\" style=\"color:var(--ink);\">45<span class=\"text-xs font-light ml-1\" style=\"color:var(--muted);\">MIN</span></div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"text-center hidden sm:block\">\n                <div class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.25em] font-light\" style=\"color:var(--muted);\">DRIFT</div>\n                <div class=\"text-base font-light mt-1\" style=\"color:var(--ink);\">0.12</div>\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"text-right\">\n                <div class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.25em] font-light\" style=\"color:var(--muted);\">GAPS</div>\n                <div class=\"text-base font-light mt-1\" style=\"color:var(--ink);\">00</div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"mt-2.5 flex items-center justify-between gap-3 px-2.5 py-2 rounded-md bottom-strip\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs tracking-[0.2em] font-light\" style=\"color:var(--muted);\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:radar-linear\" style=\"color:var(--indigo);\"></iconify-icon>\n            CH-07\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex-1 h-1 rounded-full overflow-hidden track\">\n            <div id=\"bar\" class=\"h-full rounded-full\" style=\"width:12%; background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--aqua),var(--indigo)); box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(79,95,213,0.45);\"></div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"text-xs tracking-[0.2em] font-light\" style=\"color:var(--ink);\"><span id=\"bar-pct\">12</span>%</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"flex flex-row md:flex-col items-center justify-between md:justify-start gap-5 shrink-0 w-full md:w-[124px] z-[5]\">\n\n        <div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center pt-2\">\n          <div class=\"relative rounded-full p-1.5 w-24 h-24 dial-base\">\n\n            <div id=\"main-dial\" class=\"absolute top-1.5 left-1.5 rounded-full cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing dial-face\" style=\"width:calc(100% - 12px); height:calc(100% - 12px); transform:rotate(var(--rotation, 0deg)); transition:transform 0.15s ease-out;\">\n              <div class=\"absolute flex items-center justify-center rounded-full left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 top-1.5 w-2.5 h-2.5\" style=\"background:#e9dfd0; box-shadow:inset 0 2px 3px rgba(45,47,70,0.28);\">\n                <div id=\"dial-marker\" class=\"rounded-full w-1 h-1\" style=\"background:var(--indigo); box-shadow:0 0 4px rgba(79,95,213,0.75);\"></div>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"absolute rounded-full pointer-events-none inset-1.5 dial-glass\"></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mt-2.5 text-xs tracking-[0.25em] font-light text-center leading-tight\" style=\"color:var(--muted);\">FOCUS<br>DIAL</div>\n\n          <div id=\"status-led\" class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full mt-2.5 transition-all duration-300\" style=\"background:#d8cec0; box-shadow:inset 0 1px 2px rgba(45,47,70,0.28), 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.78);\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1 p-1.5 rounded-[14px] w-full button-tray\">\n          <button data-selected=\"false\" class=\"btn flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 h-8 w-full rounded-lg border-none text-xs tracking-[0.15em] font-normal cursor-pointer transition-all duration-100\" style=\"font-family:inherit; color:#747b91; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbf8f1,#e9dfd0); box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(45,47,70,0.16), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.92), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(79,95,213,0.10);\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:target-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>GOAL\n          </button>\n\n          <button data-selected=\"true\" class=\"btn flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 h-8 w-full rounded-lg border-none text-xs tracking-[0.15em] font-normal cursor-pointer transition-all duration-100\" style=\"font-family:inherit; color:#ffffff; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#8b6ef7,#4f5fd5); box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.38), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(44,52,150,0.32), 0 0 10px rgba(79,95,213,0.35);\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>SCAF\n          </button>\n\n          <button data-selected=\"false\" class=\"btn flex items-center justify-center gap-1.5 h-8 w-full rounded-lg border-none text-xs tracking-[0.15em] font-normal cursor-pointer transition-all duration-100\" style=\"font-family:inherit; color:#747b91; background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fbf8f1,#e9dfd0); box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(45,47,70,0.16), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.92), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(79,95,213,0.10);\">\n            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:check-circle-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>CHECK\n          </button>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-3 w-full max-w-[760px] justify-between\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-xs tracking-[0.2em] font-light\" style=\"color:var(--muted);\">\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\">\n        <span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background:var(--aqua); box-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(94,223,210,0.70);\"></span>\n        LIVE\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hidden sm:block\">UPLINK 99.2%</div>\n      <div class=\"hidden sm:block\">TZ-PST</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <button class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs tracking-[0.2em] font-normal transition-all duration-200 cta-button\" style=\"font-family:inherit;\">\n      OPEN LEARNING CONSOLE\n      <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" class=\"text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n    </button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\nconst prefersReduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n\nfunction initBackgroundShader() {\n  const host = document.getElementById('shader-bg');\n  const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n  const camera = new THREE.OrthographicCamera(-1, 1, 1, -1, 0, 1);\n  const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ alpha: true, antialias: false, premultipliedAlpha: false });\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2));\n  renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n  renderer.domElement.className = 'fixed inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none';\n  renderer.domElement.setAttribute('aria-hidden', 'true');\n  host.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n\n  const uniforms = {\n    u_resolution: { value: new THREE.Vector2(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight) },\n    u_time: { value: 0 },\n    u_pointer: { value: new THREE.Vector2(0.5, 0.5) }\n  };\n\n  const fragmentShader = `\n    precision highp float;\n    uniform vec2 u_resolution;\n    uniform float u_time;\n    uniform vec2 u_pointer;\n\n    float random(vec2 st) {\n      return fract(sin(dot(st.xy, vec2(12.9898,78.233))) * 43758.5453123);\n    }\n\n    vec3 palette(float y, float t) {\n      vec3 base = vec3(0.090, 0.110, 0.170);\n      vec3 indigo = vec3(0.310, 0.372, 0.835);\n      vec3 violet = vec3(0.545, 0.431, 0.969);\n      vec3 aqua = vec3(0.368, 0.875, 0.824);\n      vec3 cream = vec3(0.945, 0.925, 0.875);\n\n      vec3 c = mix(base, indigo, smoothstep(0.00, 0.34, y));\n      c = mix(c, violet, smoothstep(0.24, 0.60, y) * (0.48 + t * 0.18));\n      c = mix(c, aqua, smoothstep(0.48, 0.86, y) * (0.36 + (1.0 - t) * 0.16));\n      c = mix(c, cream, smoothstep(0.78, 1.0, y));\n      return c;\n    }\n\n    void main() {\n      vec2 st = gl_FragCoord.xy / u_resolution.xy;\n      float numBars = 11.0;\n      float barIndex = floor(st.x * numBars);\n      float t = barIndex / (numBars - 1.0);\n\n      float pointerDrift = (u_pointer.x - 0.5) * 0.030 * sin(t * 6.2831 + u_time * 0.22);\n      float anim = sin(u_time * 0.45 + t * 3.0) * 0.018;\n      float jag = (random(vec2(barIndex, floor(u_time * 1.8))) - 0.5) * 0.014;\n      float targetHeight = 0.12 + pow(t, 1.28) * 0.54 + anim + jag + pointerDrift;\n\n      float columnEdge = step(0.966, fract(st.x * numBars));\n      float horizon = smoothstep(targetHeight - 0.012, targetHeight + 0.004, st.y);\n\n      vec3 gradientColor = palette(clamp(st.y / max(targetHeight, 0.001), 0.0, 1.0), t);\n      gradientColor *= 0.90 + 0.14 * random(vec2(barIndex, 1.0));\n      gradientColor -= columnEdge * 0.040;\n\n      vec3 sky = vec3(0.930, 0.935, 0.960);\n      sky += vec3(0.006, 0.000, 0.012) * sin(st.y * 10.0 + st.x * 2.0);\n\n      vec3 color = mix(gradientColor, sky, horizon);\n\n      float grain = (random(st * u_resolution.xy + u_time * 118.0) - 0.5) * 0.11;\n      float fine = (random((st + vec2(u_time * 0.013, -u_time * 0.021)) * 920.0) - 0.5) * 0.032;\n      color += grain + fine;\n\n      float vignette = smoothstep(0.92, 0.22, distance(st, vec2(0.5)));\n      color = mix(color * 0.90, color, vignette);\n\n      gl_FragColor = vec4(color, 1.0);\n    }\n  `;\n\n  const vertexShader = `\n    void main() {\n      gl_Position = vec4(position.xy, 0.0, 1.0);\n    }\n  `;\n\n  const material = new THREE.ShaderMaterial({\n    uniforms,\n    vertexShader,\n    fragmentShader,\n    depthWrite: false,\n    depthTest: false\n  });\n\n  const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.PlaneGeometry(2, 2), material);\n  scene.add(mesh);\n\n  function resize() {\n    renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n    uniforms.u_resolution.value.set(window.innerWidth * renderer.getPixelRatio(), window.innerHeight * renderer.getPixelRatio());\n  }\n\n  window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n  window.addEventListener('pointermove', (e) => {\n    uniforms.u_pointer.value.set(e.clientX / window.innerWidth, 1 - e.clientY / window.innerHeight);\n  }, { passive: true });\n\n  const start = performance.now();\n\n  function render() {\n    uniforms.u_time.value = prefersReduced ? 0 : (performance.now() - start) / 1000;\n    renderer.render(scene, camera);\n    requestAnimationFrame(render);\n  }\n\n  resize();\n  render();\n}\n\nconst elCount = document.getElementById('val-count');\nconst elStatus = document.getElementById('val-status');\nconst led = document.getElementById('status-led');\nconst bar = document.getElementById('bar');\nconst barPct = document.getElementById('bar-pct');\n\nlet count = 0;\nconst target = 8;\nconst countDuration = prefersReduced ? 300 : 3200;\nconst startTime = Date.now();\n\nfunction animateCount() {\n  const elapsed = Date.now() - startTime;\n  const progress = Math.min(elapsed / countDuration, 1);\n  const eased = 1 - Math.pow(1 - progress, 3);\n\n  count = Math.floor(eased * target);\n  elCount.innerText = String(count).padStart(2, '0');\n\n  const pct = Math.round(12 + eased * 76);\n  bar.style.width = pct + '%';\n  barPct.innerText = pct;\n\n  if (progress < 1) {\n    requestAnimationFrame(animateCount);\n  } else {\n    elCount.innerText = '08';\n    elStatus.innerHTML = '<span class=\"inline-block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background:var(--violet); box-shadow:0 0 6px rgba(139,110,247,0.70);\"></span> READY / REVIEW';\n    led.style.background = 'var(--violet)';\n    led.style.boxShadow = 'inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.62), 0 0 12px rgba(139,110,247,0.85)';\n  }\n}\n\nsetTimeout(animateCount, 400);\n\ndocument.querySelectorAll('.btn').forEach(b => {\n  b.addEventListener('click', (e) => {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.btn').forEach(btn => {\n      btn.setAttribute('data-selected', 'false');\n      btn.style.color = '#747b91';\n      btn.style.background = 'linear-gradient(180deg,#fbf8f1,#e9dfd0)';\n      btn.style.boxShadow = '0 2px 4px rgba(45,47,70,0.16), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.92), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(79,95,213,0.10)';\n    });\n\n    const cur = e.currentTarget;\n    cur.setAttribute('data-selected', 'true');\n    cur.style.color = '#ffffff';\n    cur.style.background = 'linear-gradient(180deg,#8b6ef7,#4f5fd5)';\n    cur.style.boxShadow = 'inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.38), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(44,52,150,0.32), 0 0 10px rgba(79,95,213,0.35)';\n  });\n});\n\nconst dial = document.getElementById('main-dial');\nlet isDragging = false;\nlet startAngle = 0;\nlet currentRotation = 0;\n\nfunction calcAngle(e, el) {\n  const rect = el.getBoundingClientRect();\n  const cx = rect.left + rect.width / 2;\n  const cy = rect.top + rect.height / 2;\n  const x = e.touches ? e.touches[0].clientX : e.clientX;\n  const y = e.touches ? e.touches[0].clientY : e.clientY;\n  return Math.atan2(y - cy, x - cx) * (180 / Math.PI);\n}\n\ndial.addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => {\n  isDragging = true;\n  startAngle = calcAngle(e, dial) - currentRotation;\n});\n\ndocument.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n  if (!isDragging) return;\n  currentRotation = calcAngle(e, dial) - startAngle;\n  dial.style.setProperty('--rotation', `${currentRotation}deg`);\n});\n\ndocument.addEventListener('mouseup', () => isDragging = false);\n\nfunction initWebGL() {\n  const canvas = document.getElementById('matrix-canvas');\n  const gl = canvas.getContext('webgl', { alpha: true, premultipliedAlpha: false });\n  if (!gl) return;\n\n  const dpr = window.devicePixelRatio || 1;\n\n  function resize() {\n    canvas.width = canvas.clientWidth * dpr;\n    canvas.height = canvas.clientHeight * dpr;\n  }\n\n  resize();\n  window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n\n  const vs = `attribute vec2 position; varying vec2 vUv; void main(){gl_Position=vec4(position,0.,1.); vUv=position*0.5+0.5;}`;\n\n  const fs = `\n    precision highp float;\n    varying vec2 vUv;\n    uniform float u_time;\n    uniform vec2 u_res;\n\n    float rand(vec2 st){ return fract(sin(dot(st.xy, vec2(12.9898,78.233)))*43758.5453123); }\n\n    void main(){\n      vec2 uv = vUv;\n\n      float gridX = 50.0;\n      float gridY = 26.0;\n      vec2 grid = fract(uv * vec2(gridX, gridY));\n      vec2 cell = floor(uv * vec2(gridX, gridY));\n      vec2 cellNorm = cell / vec2(gridX, gridY);\n\n      float d = distance(grid, vec2(0.5));\n      float dotShape = 1.0 - smoothstep(0.18, 0.32, d);\n\n      float thread1 = sin(cellNorm.x * 6.0 + u_time * 0.4) * 0.15 + 0.5;\n      float thread2 = sin(cellNorm.x * 4.0 - u_time * 0.3 + 1.5) * 0.18 + 0.35;\n      float thread3 = sin(cellNorm.x * 5.0 + u_time * 0.5 + 3.0) * 0.12 + 0.65;\n\n      float threadGlow = 0.0;\n      threadGlow += smoothstep(0.04, 0.0, abs(cellNorm.y - thread1));\n      threadGlow += smoothstep(0.04, 0.0, abs(cellNorm.y - thread2));\n      threadGlow += smoothstep(0.04, 0.0, abs(cellNorm.y - thread3));\n\n      float cellNoise = rand(cell);\n      float pulse = sin(u_time * 1.2 + cellNoise * 8.0) * 0.5 + 0.5;\n      float baseIntensity = mix(0.05, 0.28, pulse * cellNoise);\n\n      float sweep1 = mod(u_time * 0.18, 1.4) - 0.2;\n      float sweepGlow = smoothstep(0.08, 0.0, abs(cellNorm.x - sweep1));\n\n      float intensity = baseIntensity + threadGlow * 0.7 + sweepGlow * 0.5;\n\n      float vig = smoothstep(0.85, 0.25, distance(uv, vec2(0.5)));\n      intensity *= mix(0.4, 1.0, vig);\n\n      vec3 indigo = vec3(0.310, 0.372, 0.835);\n      vec3 violet = vec3(0.545, 0.431, 0.969);\n      vec3 aqua = vec3(0.368, 0.875, 0.824);\n      vec3 dotColor = mix(indigo, violet, intensity);\n      dotColor = mix(dotColor, aqua, sweepGlow * 0.38);\n\n      vec3 bg = vec3(0.984, 0.972, 0.945);\n      float scanline = sin(uv.y * 380.0) * 0.006;\n      bg -= scanline;\n\n      vec3 finalColor = mix(bg, dotColor, dotShape * intensity * 0.9);\n\n      gl_FragColor = vec4(finalColor, 1.0);\n    }\n  `;\n\n  function compile(type, src) {\n    const s = gl.createShader(type);\n    gl.shaderSource(s, src);\n    gl.compileShader(s);\n    return s;\n  }\n\n  const prog = gl.createProgram();\n  gl.attachShader(prog, compile(gl.VERTEX_SHADER, vs));\n  gl.attachShader(prog, compile(gl.FRAGMENT_SHADER, fs));\n  gl.linkProgram(prog);\n  gl.useProgram(prog);\n\n  const buf = gl.createBuffer();\n  gl.bindBuffer(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, buf);\n  gl.bufferData(gl.ARRAY_BUFFER, new Float32Array([-1,-1,1,-1,-1,1,1,1]), gl.STATIC_DRAW);\n\n  const posLoc = gl.getAttribLocation(prog, 'position');\n  gl.enableVertexAttribArray(posLoc);\n  gl.vertexAttribPointer(posLoc, 2, gl.FLOAT, false, 0, 0);\n\n  const uTime = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'u_time');\n  const uRes = gl.getUniformLocation(prog, 'u_res');\n  const start = Date.now();\n\n  function render() {\n    resize();\n    gl.viewport(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n\n    const t = prefersReduced ? 0 : (Date.now() - start) / 1000;\n    gl.uniform1f(uTime, t);\n    gl.uniform2f(uRes, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n    gl.drawArrays(gl.TRIANGLE_STRIP, 0, 4);\n\n    requestAnimationFrame(render);\n  }\n\n  render();\n}\n\nfunction animateScanline() {\n  if (prefersReduced) return;\n\n  const el = document.getElementById('scanline');\n  let pos = -80;\n\n  setInterval(() => {\n    pos += 4;\n    if (pos > el.parentElement.offsetWidth + 80) pos = -80;\n    el.style.left = pos + 'px';\n  }, 30);\n}\n\nfunction breatheDial() {\n  if (prefersReduced) return;\n\n  const m = document.getElementById('dial-marker');\n  let t = 0;\n\n  setInterval(() => {\n    t += 0.05;\n    const glow = 4 + Math.sin(t) * 3;\n    m.style.boxShadow = `0 0 ${glow}px rgba(79,95,213,${0.55 + Math.sin(t) * 0.25})`;\n  }, 50);\n}\n\nwindow.addEventListener('load', () => {\n  initBackgroundShader();\n  initWebGL();\n  animateScanline();\n  breatheDial();\n});\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "lesson-loom-signal-scanner.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/lesson-loom-signal-scanner.jpg", "source_name": "lesson-loom-signal-scanner-DESIGN.md", "views": 94, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "66a84ecf-0972-40f3-8a4c-15b11d3aee0a", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T21:06:13.462734+00:00"}